Error: 403: {"error":"Context requires its actual accountable run"}

Root cause: foundationBootstrapService.collect invoked contextEngineService.assemble without the actual heartbeat Run. Its generated foundation bootstrap id is not a runtime Run, and Context correctly rejects it. The fix uses Human read-only Context inspection for pre-run discovery and passes the active publication transaction into current-source reads; agent writes use their actual live Run and bootstrap Task.
